<http://www.Department0.University0.edu/UndergraduateStudent0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.lehigh.edu/~zhp2/2004/0401/univ-bench.owl#UndergraduateStudent> .
